{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shuffle, Match, and Master the Grid!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>Hexa Harmony</strong>, a relaxing yet challenging puzzle game where your goal is simple: place matching tiles together and clear the board. Sounds easy? Think again! Every move counts, and strategic placement is key to forming perfect matches and achieving high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide cards across the hexagonal grid, merge matching colors and symbols, and plan ahead to avoid filling up the space. With vibrant visuals, smooth gameplay, and satisfying chain reactions, <strong>Hexa Harmony</strong> delivers pure puzzle bliss!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udfe8 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Addictive tile-merging gameplay</strong> with a clever twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Colorful, cartoony graphics</strong> with a polished UI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd8 <strong>Relaxing yet strategic</strong>, perfect for short sessions or long play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Endless replayability</strong> \u2013 every round is a new challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Score-chasing fun</strong> \u2013 beat your personal best</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual gamer or a puzzle enthusiast, <strong>Hexa Harmony</strong> is the perfect game to unwind and sharpen your mind. Can you master the shuffle?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900540?t=1754732056","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900540?t=1754732056","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900540/70a5ba3978b3ae8ffcafb77a7c4a1b34abd514b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754732056","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.